  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Raging Hurler",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Ultimate Combat pg. 114",
    "definition_raw": "Source Ultimate Combat pg. 114\nAn opponent can do little to evade your wrathful pitching of weapons and objects.\n\nPrerequisites: Rage class feature, Throw Anything.\n\nBenefit: While raging, you can throw a two-handed weapon as a standard action, and you double the range increment for weapons you throw. If you also have the Quick Draw feat, you can throw two-handed weapons at your full normal rate of attacks. Further, you can pick up an unattended object that you can use as a improvised weapon within your reach as part of the attack action to throw that item.",
